    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Subterranean Assault",
    "summary": "Reroll [hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) of 1 for each attacking **TYRANIDS** model in your army. Each time your **BURROWER** unit deploys from Reserves onto the battlefield, put down a Tunnel marker 40 mm across. Place it no farther than 1\" from the arrival and over 3\" away horizontally from all opponents’ units. You may use a Tunnel marker to bring a unit in from Reserves during Reinforcements in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase). Set it up entirely within the marker’s 9\" radius and over 6\" away horizontally from enemy units. An enemy model ending any move 3\" or less from the marker removes it. **AIRCRAFT** never remove it this way.",
